From bb716f6feda9df2575d1f58a0e26f7e0079eb21b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:31:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dicts: RBKP_2 - the stock save buttons sit BELOW the injected
 card, not above

The full-backup description has said "the buttons above save" since v2.7.2,
but the card is inserted before FormTitle, so the stock Save/Upload buttons
render below it. Surfaced by the master-panel render pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/EN.dict | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/EN.dict b/release/src/router/www/EN.dict
index 2285ef7b2f..1f9ed92c2d 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/EN.dict
+++ b/release/src/router/www/EN.dict
@@ -6719,7 +6719,7 @@ RWDN_90=(unnamed)
 RWIF_83=Error
 RWIF_84=block
 RBKP_1=Full backup (settings + Reaper data)
-RBKP_2=One file that carries everything: the router settings file the buttons above save, plus the Reaper stores that live outside it - the Gatekeeper device list, the firewall lists and their domain-set cache, the routing rules, and the Warden lists. The stock file inside stays readable by stock and Merlin firmware.
+RBKP_2=One file that carries everything: the router settings file the stock buttons below save, plus the Reaper stores that live outside it - the Gatekeeper device list, the firewall lists and their domain-set cache, the routing rules, and the Warden lists. The stock file inside stays readable by stock and Merlin firmware.
 RBKP_3=Download full backup
 RBKP_4=Restore full backup...
 RBKP_5=Restore checks that the file matches this router model, restores the router settings, and reboots. After the reboot, log back in and click Complete restore when prompted - firewall and routing lists are staged for review on their pages, never applied blind.
